ative.\n\n\n### Examples:\n\nThis what you will see it in the editor, and in the runtime of most languages (example: russian).\n<img width=\"1142\" height=\"639\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6b014701-9340-42c2-b4e5-49edea52a8af\" />\n\n\nThis is the same poject, but run while the pc primery language was set to arabic (algir) \n<img width=\"1142\" height=\"636\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/41ff2f3f-48c8-43c0-8c48-67e7bf543fb1\" />\n\nAnd if you change the x cordinates of the button to be the same but negative, the button will appear again\n<img width=\"1085\" height=\"607\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/407a14d3-4246-4e0f-b677-cd47a3dc8910\" />\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. change your pc primary language to one that writen from right to left\n2. have a 2d node with a gui child\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[bug-testeble-project.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25866535/bug-testeble-project.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"mutedfishman","id":263472528,"node_id":"U_kgDOD7RFkA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/263472528?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mutedfishman","html_url":"https://github.com/mutedfishman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mutedfishman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mutedfishman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mutedfishman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mutedfishman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mutedfishman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mutedfishman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mutedfishman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mutedfishman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mutedfishman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_ty